{"id":"faef7f440a70d7b2","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-church.md","title":"Church论题","display":"df-church — Church论题","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-church","aliases":["29-df-church"],"display":"df-church — Church论题","depends_on":["[[29-df-tm-computes]]"],"revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-church"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-church</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-church — Church论题"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d91cca50bc997dfa\" href=\"?note=d91cca50bc997dfa\" title=\"29-df-tm-computes\">29-df-tm-computes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29.zip修订；原source_locator及过去核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学接口审查及静态结构/链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\{f\\mid f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\{f\\mid f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 为给定集合参数，不假定可判定、可枚举或等于任何机器类。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Computes}\">\\(\\operatorname{Computes}\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d91cca50bc997dfa\" href=\"?note=d91cca50bc997dfa\" title=\"29-df-tm-computes\">29-df-tm-computes</a> 定义；本条仅定义关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 的命题 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}_k(\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}_k(\\mathcal E)\\)</span>，不无条件断言该命题。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}_k(\\mathcal E)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathcal E\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_k\\;\\operatorname{Computes}(M,f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CT}_k(\\mathcal E)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathcal E\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_k\\;\\operatorname{Computes}(M,f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Church–Turing 论题把直观上的有效可计算函数与机器可计算函数联系起来。直观“有效可计算”并不是已有的形式谓词；将它直接作为 Assertion 的未解释谓词不能得到自包含定义。因此保留文件名和主题，将其形式内容明确为参数化命题。这里既不把论题当作定理，也不偷偷令参数等于机器可计算函数而使之成为同义反复。</p>\n<p>本次来源边界：以上原书定位与过往核对叙述继承自所给文件，不表示本次重新查看了原书或完成机器证明；本次修补以现有文本的类型、条件和依赖闭合为依据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-tm-computes","status":"resolved","id":"d91cca50bc997dfa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-tm-computes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tm-computes","status":"resolved","id":"d91cca50bc997dfa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}_k$、$\\operatorname{Computes}$ 由 [[29-df-tm-computes]] 定义；本条仅定义关于 $\\mathcal E$ 的命题 $\\mathrm{CT}_k(\\mathcal E)$，不无条件断言该命题。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E\\subseteq\\{f\\mid f:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Computes}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}_k(\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}_k(\\mathcal E)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall f\\in\\mathcal E\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}_k\\;\\operatorname{Computes}(M,f).","display":true}],"bytes":1691,"backlinks":[{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-church]]"}],"outgoing":["d91cca50bc997dfa"]}